  "prefLabel": "He-P 2703.06 Renewal of Licenses",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-12-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2703.06 Renewal of Licenses.\n\n(a) To renew, an applicant shall submit:\n\n(1) All items listed in He-P 2703.01(b) along with any supporting documentation;\n\n(2) Any changes to information provided to the department on the initial application; and\n\n(3) Payment as specified in He-P 2706.01(b).\n\n(b) Licenses for milk plants, producer-distributors, and distributors shall be renewed provided the following conditions exist at the time of renewal:\n\n(1) No milk or milk products from the plant, sampled and analyzed by the department, exceed the quality standards in Mil 301 on 2 of the last 4 samples;\n\n(2) A minimum score of 90 on the last federal rating is obtained by a grade A out-of-state milk plant or producer-distributor license holder;\n\n(3) The copy of the latest inspection submitted by an out-of-state non-grade A milk plants and producer-distributors shows compliance with Mil 301;\n\n(4) The distributor has submitted a complete application as required in (a) above; and\n\n(5) There is no violation of RSA 184:86.\n\n(c) Each licensee wishing to renew his or her license shall apply pursuant to (a) above at least 30 days prior to the expiration of the current license.\n\nSource. #7315, eff 7-1-00; ss by #9189, INTERIM, eff 7-1-08, EXPIRES: 12-28-08; ss by #9325, eff 11-21-08; ss by #10956, eff 10-22-15; ss by #12101, eff 2-3-17; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
